{ In the declined Morra, ...d3 returns the pawn and keeps the c-file closed. A queen on c7 is therefore less exposed than in many accepted lines. Aman uses ...Nc6, ...d6, ...g6 and ...Bg4, aiming to trade White's f3-knight. } 1. e4 c5 2. d4 cxd4 3. c3 d3 { Decline by returning the pawn. } 4. Bxd3 Nc6 5. Nf3 d6 { Play ...d6 before the fianchetto so the c8-bishop can reach g4. } 6. O-O g6 7. Re1 Bg4 { Offer the bishop for White's f3-knight. } 8. Be3 Bg7 9. Nbd2 Nf6 10. h3 Bxf3 11. Nxf3 O-O *

